            "answer": "<strong>NMN Capsules</strong> - to boost cellular energy and support DNA repair and healthy ageing via increased NAD⁺ levels <br><br><strong>Liposomal Spermidine</strong> - to trigger autophagy, the body’s natural “cell-clean up and renewal” process, helping cells clear damaged components and stay youthful.<br><br><strong>Liposomal Curcumin</strong> - to provide antioxidant and anti-inflammatory support, protecting cells from oxidative stress and creating a healthier internal environment"
