        "question_WrRAEp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How should I take the supplements and when?",
            "answer": "<strong>NMN</strong>: Recommended first thing in the morning, on an empty stomach. This timing is chosen to align with natural NAD⁺ metabolic cycles and support steady daytime energy.<br><br><strong>Liposomal Spermidine and Curcumin</strong>: Can be taken alongside or after food. Liposomal formats are used to improve absorption and effectiveness."
