            "answer": "Yes - NMN, Liposomal Spermidine, and Liposomal Curcumin are all generally well-tolerated and considered safe when taken at the recommended dosages.<br><br>Each product in this bundle goes through strict quality and safety checks:<br><br><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>NMN</strong>: Third-party tested for purity (>99.5%), heavy metals, and contaminants.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Liposomal Spermidine</strong>: Uses a clean, vegan liposomal delivery system designed for enhanced absorption with no unnecessary additives.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Liposomal Curcumin</strong>: Formulated to improve bioavailability using a safe, food-grade liposomal format.</li>\n</ul><br>The three supplements work through different biological pathways (NAD⁺ support, autophagy activation, and inflammation reduction), and there are <strong>no known negative interactions</strong> when taken together."
